<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen killed 24 people in separate attacks in Nigeria and bandits killed an immigration officer and burned his body in Niger State. Fulani militants hacked 12 Christians to death in Benue and killed civilians in Plateau and Niger, while Islamic terrorists assaulted three villages in northeast Nigeria. Ansaru terrorists planned an attack on a school in Oyo. Russian fighters and the Malian army retook the strategic northern town of Kidal after separatists withdrew. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQNm52LUpzM3lIbkZoZ19nako3elM0NWgxTE9RSG1lZGQyRURvU2s1alRaX2EwRjFEYkRac2JlNDdHcE1KdFN0aVBoMFMtcnBaZXRRM3kzLU1JWS1EUHU1YmVuVk13b0NZdm5NTkpzRzVGalNLRjBBRzJmLWVaT252MkNJTFpyVnhzTlhnd0Zfb1VhVTZXTGZlakt1VkY2RVdnZVB0VmdrSGV4ZjFhQnVjd2VhbEthY2hx?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;TheStar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxOamlrMzV0b3VPV0kxWFBlN1NfSDVONU1INGxDUG9yclI3Wjc5UW5Zb3RjM3BZNnQ3MkJIWTczWDFLY0M0bGNhMTNXWFYxNmZGR04wQzlfdjR1MkNiZjRDY0tEQVJMNjhZNkFfeHd3UndfWlVxdXQ2UGpQbnk4WGVtZGFuMUYtenRMZXBkSEJB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Report Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQMEx2NW53VUl5UFN3dHZsRUFkWkdDS1dXM2dmU2Vfdm9zZndrZFhscHR1cDRIc1d3WGZ4R1VvQTN6X3pRaU1UM1YtNUtZSVpNd0tmVkhxbkVxU1l3UUhHX1NhX056VGNRZWF4QW90bTNRM0VEcDVUYU1xaUFLQW9BeEpnMGN2SFpGWklzemdyamdiejg?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsDiaryOnline&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOLVB2VkVRLUU4STF3NmxyRjdUV1RadWx4Q1F3LTBYOHByZUM